【茜】[r]「呃……那到底是怎么回事啊～？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]放学后。班会刚结束铃声就响起，茜箭步冲到我座位劈头就问。
[np]

[sousi storage="C_seifuku_M CD_1_M"]
[playcv storage="sousi_supica_00340_001.ogg" name="sousi"]
[character name="sousi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="sousi_CD_1_FACE_seifuku"]
【爽史】[r]「你说的是哪件事？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[akane storage="C_seifuku_M CD_2_M"]
[playcv storage="akane_supica_00340_002.ogg" name="akane"]
[character name="akane"]
[FACEVIEW storage="akane_CD_2_FACE_seifuku"]
【茜】[r]「哎呀你听我说爽史！今天午休时，龙一在走廊上藏着个可爱的小姑娘呢！」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[sousi storage="D_seifuku_M CD_6B_M"]
[playcv storage="sousi_supica_00340_002.ogg" name="sousi"]
[character name="sousi"]
[FACEVIEW storage="sousi_CD_6B_FACE_seifuku"]
【爽史】[r]「可爱的小姑娘……？大概小学几年级？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[akane storage="C_seifuku_M CD_1_M"]
[playcv storage="akane_supica_00340_003.ogg" name="akane"]
[character name="akane"]
[FACEVIEW storage="akane_CD_1_FACE_seifuku"]
【茜】[r]「当初看上你算我瞎了眼。所以呢龙一？那孩子该不会是…」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「既然你们问起…我和那孩子开始交往了」
[np]

[akane storage="B_seifuku_M AB_2_M" trans=false]
[sousi storage="A_seifuku_M A_11_M" trans=false]
[char_trans]

[playcv storage="akane_supica_00340_004.ogg" name="akane"]
[character name="akane"]
[FACEVIEW storage="akane_AB_2_FACE_seifuku"]

[char_jump name=akane]

【茜】[r]「嗯——果然和我想的一样！那个孩子是真珠星酱对吧？也就是说你们在搞宿舍恋爱！？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「不知道有没有这种说法…不过算是吧」
[np]

[akane storage="C_seifuku_M CD_3_M" trans=false]
[sousi storage="A_seifuku_M A_1_M" trans=false]
[char_trans]

[playcv storage="akane_supica_00340_005.ogg" name="akane"]
[character name="akane"]
[FACEVIEW storage="akane_CD_3_FACE_seifuku"]
【茜】[r]「什么时候喜欢上的？谁先告白的？当时说了什么决胜台词！？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「我、我凭什么要说到这个份上！」
[np]

[akane storage="C_seifuku_M CD_7_M"]
[playcv storage="akane_supica_00340_006.ogg" name="akane"]
[character name="akane"]
[FACEVIEW storage="akane_CD_7_FACE_seifuku"]
【茜】[r]「切～还以为你会趁势全盘托出呢…等等，不对啊？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[chisato storage="A_seifuku_M AB_8_M"]
[playcv storage="chisato_supica_00340_001.ogg" name="chisato"]
[character name="chisato"]
[FACEVIEW storage="chisato_AB_8_FACE_seifuku"]
【千圣】[r]「怎么了？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[char_erase name="akane chisato sousi"]

[akane storage="B_seifuku_L AB_2_L"]
[playcv storage="akane_supica_00340_007.ogg" name="akane"]
[character name="akane"]
[FACEVIEW storage="akane_AB_2_FACE_seifuku"]
【茜】[r]「……哼哼。明明交往没多久，就已经如胶似漆了呢，这位小哥～」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[char_erase name="akane"]

[r]被茜用手肘轻轻顶了一下，我正纳闷怎么回事，往周围看去……
[np]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「啊……」
[np]

[supica storage="A_seifuku_M A_1_M" relx= 250]

[r]只见站在走廊的真珠星一和我对上视线，就微微张开了樱唇。
[np]

[r]难道是在等我……一起回家？
[np]

[char_erase name="supica"]

[akane storage="A_seifuku_L AB_1_L"]
[playcv storage="akane_supica_00340_008.ogg" name="akane"]
[character name="akane"]
[FACEVIEW storage="akane_AB_1_FACE_seifuku"]
【茜】[r]「好啦，快过去吧。让可爱的女朋友等着可不好哦」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「啊，好的……不好意思，那我先走了！」
[np]

[akane storage="B_seifuku_L AB_2_L"]
[playcv storage="akane_supica_00340_009.ogg" name="akane"]
[character name="akane"]
[FACEVIEW storage="akane_AB_2_FACE_seifuku"]
【茜】[r]「要幸福哦～♪」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

